## PHASE 3 — VERIFY

### `flutter test` (full suite)
```
00:19 +10: All tests passed!
```
All 10 tests pass (6 new voice-input scenarios + 4 pre-existing widget/body-map
tests). No regressions.

### `flutter analyze`
```
5 issues found.
```
The 5 issues are all pre-existing `deprecated_member_use` *info* diagnostics in
`lib/core/constants/muscle_vectors.dart` and
`lib/ui/organisms/interactive_body_map.dart` — **none in M9 code**. Out of scope
for this milestone and left untouched.

### `flutter build apk --release`
Android manifest validated as well-formed XML with `RECORD_AUDIO` present.
Full Gradle `assembleRelease` exceeded the 10-minute tool timeout on first run
(dependency downloads); structural validation passed. Recommended to run on a
real device / CI for a full build.

